  <!-- =================== FAQ =================== -->
  <section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-grid">
        <div class="faq-sidebar reveal">
          <p class="section-label">FAQ</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Common Questions</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 36px;">Have more questions? Don't hesitate to reach out — we're always happy to help.</p>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              How long does a full detail take?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>It depends on the package and vehicle size. A basic detail typically takes 2–3 hours, while premium services including paint correction and ceramic coating can take 1–3 days. We'll always give you an accurate time estimate when you book.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              Do I need to do anything before dropping off my car?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Just remove any personal items from the vehicle. There's no need to wash it beforehand — in fact, we prefer to assess the true condition on arrival. Everything else is handled by our team.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              How long does ceramic coating last?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Our professional-grade ceramic coatings are rated for 3–5 years with proper maintenance. We provide full aftercare guidance and recommend annual maintenance inspections to maximize longevity.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              Do you offer mobile detailing?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes — we offer mobile detailing for select services within the Demo City area. Contact us to check availability and scheduling. Note that paint correction and ceramic coating require our facility environment for best results.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              What payment methods do you accept?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>We accept all major credit/debit cards, cash, Venmo, and Zelle. Payment is due upon completion of services. A deposit may be required for large-scale or multi-day services.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
              Can paint correction remove all scratches?
              <span class="faq-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Paint correction can eliminate or significantly reduce the vast majority of swirls, light scratches, and oxidation. Deep scratches that penetrate the primer or metal may require touch-up paint or bodywork. We'll assess your paint and give you an honest evaluation before starting.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

